:: Mom Bedroom Clothes [micro_event event nobr] {"position":"1800,2775","size":"100,100"}
/* Privacy: she brings your laundry. Let her in, talk through the door, or pretend to be asleep. */
<p>There's a soft knock on my door.</p>
<<silently>>
<<set _msgs to [
	{ who: $mom, text: "Sweetheart? I did your laundry. Can I come in for a second?" }
]>>
<</silently>>
<<Chat _msgs>>
<div id="choice1">
	<div>
		<<link "Let her in">>
			<<replace "#choice1">>
				<<Video "images/characters/mom/events/bedroom/mom_enter.webm" "" "" 500>>
				<<silently>>
				<<set _msgs to [
					{ who: $player, text: "Sure, come in." },
					{ text: "She sets the basket of folded clothes on the end of the bed." },
					{ who: $mom, text: "Here you go, all folded, and I got that stain out of your gray shirt, which took two tries and half a bottle of dish soap, so now you have to wear it." },
					{ who: $player, text: "Thanks, $mom.callName. Honestly, I would have just worn it with the stain." },
					{ who: $mom, text: "Oh, I know you would have, honey. That's exactly why I did it." }
				]>>
				<</silently>>
				<<Chat _msgs>>
				<br>
				<<if $company.prototype.progress >= 40>>
					<p>Her eyes drift to my desk, where the prototype is sitting between the cables and half-empty coffee cups.</p>
					<<silently>>
					<<set _msgs to [
						{ who: $mom, text: "Is that the thing you've been working on all this time?" },
						{ who: $player, text: "Yeah, it's a sensor thing. It's pretty boring unless you're the one building it." },
						{ who: $mom, text: "Well, it looks very complicated, and I'm sure it's brilliant. Just promise me you're sleeping at some point and not sitting up with it until three in the morning again." }
					]>>
					<</silently>>
					<<Chat _msgs>>
				<</if>>
				<<UpdateStat "+" "MomRelation" 1>>
			<</replace>>
		<</link>>
	</div>
	<div>
		<<link "Ask her to leave it outside">>
			<<replace "#choice1">>
				<<silently>>
				<<set _msgs to [
					{ who: $player, text: "Can you leave it outside? I'm in the middle of something." },
					{ who: $mom, text: "Of course, sweetie, I'll leave it right by the door. Don't work too hard, okay?" }
				]>>
				<</silently>>
				<<Chat _msgs>>
				<p>I hear the basket touch the floor and her footsteps fade down the stairs.</p>
			<</replace>>
		<</link>>
	</div>
	<div>
		<<link "Pretend to be asleep">>
			<<replace "#choice1">>
				<p>I close my eyes and slow my breathing. The door opens carefully. She crosses the room on tiptoe, puts the basket on the chair, and stands there for a moment.</p>
				<<silently>>
				<<set _msgs to [
					{ who: $mom, text: "Sleep well, honey." }
				]>>
				<</silently>>
				<<Chat _msgs>>
				<p>The door closes with barely a click.</p>
				<<UpdateStat "+" "MomRelation" 1>>
			<</replace>>
		<</link>>
	</div>
</div>
